-
-## 🛠️ Tech Stack
-
-| Layer | Tech |
-|---|---|
-| Frontend | React 18, TypeScript, Vite 6, Tailwind CSS 3, React Router 7 |
-| Mobile | Capacitor 7 (Android) |
-| Backend | Express 4, TypeScript, tsx |
-| Database | PostgreSQL + Prisma 6 |
-| Auth | JWT + bcryptjs |
-| Validation | Zod |
-| Design | Liquid Glass theme (custom CSS tokens) |
-
